{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["My Bride is a Mermaid OVA","The OVAs are new stand alone shorts with characters from the series and introduces two new ones. It is now the third year of school, San and Luna's dads are still being over protective. All the while Nagasumi has his hands full trying to keep everyone around him under control and rescuing damsels in distress. \n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["瀬戸の花嫁 OVA",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":2104,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-4163","ids":{"shikimori":4163,"mal":4163,"anilist":4163,"kodik":"serial-23813"},"kodikIds":["serial-6619","serial-23813"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-6619":"2020-03-18T00:49:50Z","serial-23813":"2020-03-18T00:50:34Z"},"title":"Морская невеста OVA","originalTitle":"Seto no Hanayome OVA","alt":"瀬戸の花嫁 OVA My Bride is a Mermaid OVA 瀬戸の花嫁 OVA","description":"Дополнительные серии, в которых, наряду со старыми, будут участвовать и два новых персонажа. Наступает третий учебный год в средней школе Сайтано. ] Сан и Луны всё ещё чрезмерно пытаются защитить своих дочерей, а Нагасуми по-прежнему пытается держать всё происходящее под контролем, попутно помогая дамам в беде...","year":2008,"type":"OVA","genres":["Сёнен","Комедия","Романтика","Сверхъестественное","организованная преступност","пародия","Школа"],"rating":7.8,"popularity":10678,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[2104],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/4163/9144b33f6eb42d3ad387f5de68919283.jpeg","width":685,"height":975},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/bb683c7f2a65c26216db55be6c3721a7ebf00370.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1176","dubId":"1176","label":"Valkrist","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"ser